# Keep the build context small and the image reproducible.
# The context is the repository root, because the corpus in data/ ships in the image.

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/venv
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache

frontend/
docs/
.git/
.github/
.claude/

# Rendered page images are regenerated on first request; shipping them would add ~100 MB.
data/corpus/*-pages/

**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
